sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as "Admin/HR/Manager"
    participant View as "Web View (admin.holidays.auto-generate)"
    participant Controller as "Admin HolidayController"
    participant Model as "Holiday Model"
    participant DB as "Database"
    participant API as "libur.deno.dev"

    Admin->>View: Buka fitur Auto Generate dan pilih tahun
    View->>Controller: GET /admin/holidays/auto-generate?year=YYYY
    Controller->>API: Request data libur nasional per tahun
    API-->>Controller: Preview daftar libur nasional
    Controller->>View: Render preview dan tombol simpan

    Admin->>View: Klik Simpan hasil preview
    View->>Controller: POST /admin/holidays/auto-generate
    Controller->>Model: Ambil data libur dari API dan cek data existing
    Model->>DB: SELECT holidays WHERE date IN (...)
    DB-->>Model: Data tanggal yang sudah ada
    Model-->>Controller: Data siap disimpan / dilewati

    alt Data valid (API berhasil dan data dapat disimpan)
        Controller->>Model: Holiday::create(...) untuk data baru
        Model->>DB: INSERT holidays baru
        DB-->>Model: Insert success
        Model-->>Controller: Auto generate selesai
        Controller->>View: Redirect index + success
        View-->>Admin: Notifikasi auto generate berhasil
    else Data tidak valid (API gagal / validasi tahun / data error)
        Controller->>View: Redirect back + error
        View-->>Admin: Notifikasi gagal auto generate
    end
